## 状态共享

### 局部状态（默认）

每次调用 composable 都创建独立的状态实例：

```typescript
// 每个组件获得独立的 count
const { count: countA } = useCounter();
const { count: countB } = useCounter();
// countA 和 countB 互不影响
```

### 全局共享状态

将状态提升到模块作用域实现跨组件共享：

```typescript
import { ref, readonly } from 'vue';

const globalCount = ref<number>(0);

export function useSharedCounter() {
  function increment() {
    globalCount.value++;
  }
  function decrement() {
    globalCount.value--;
  }

  return {
    count: readonly(globalCount),
    increment,
    decrement,
  };
}
```

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph Module["模块作用域"]
        GS["globalCount (共享状态)"]
    end
    subgraph Comp1["组件 A"]
        A1["useSharedCounter()"] --> GS
    end
    subgraph Comp2["组件 B"]
        B1["useSharedCounter()"] --> GS
    end
```

